"Choose contacts that will always play notifications at full volume, even "
"when the phone is in Silent or Do Not Disturb mode."
msgstr ""
"Agħżel kuntatti li dejjem se jilagħbu n-notifiki bil-volum sħiħ, anke meta t-"
"telefon ikun fil-modalità Siekta jew Tfixkilx."

